                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f972f68-8fd5-4cad-a0f7-9873445c45b8",
                                                "sense_id": "34b49372-2968-3ae1-9b93-57972d25be64",
                                                "text": "Creating your fireworks display in Minecraft involves a mix of crafting skills and a touch of redstone engineering. From the basics of crafting fireworks to setting up a grand display using redstone circuits, this guide will cover it all. […] However, for a more controlled and elaborate display, using redstone can be advantageous."
